  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Fire On My Tongue** (1 other source): Fire On My Tongue segues into Must Be Seven, with the track flow running through to End Of The Rainbow [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greeting/Crowd**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Heartache Of America**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Rank Stranger**: back after 70 archived shows (717 days) [4]\n- **Thanks**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-02-16** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 132 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings2022-02-16.ck1.mitchell.flac2448**: source not stated; 21 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The listener saw the tapers set up their gear in the venue's old sound booth [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-02-16**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V's>Lunatec V2>Sound Devices 722 (24/44.1) [1]. Also: Processed from the 722 through Sound Forge 10, CD Wave, then FLAC at 16-bit, tagged in Foobar2000; seeded by Z-Man [1]\n- **billystrings2022-02-16.ck1.mitchell.flac2448**: taped by Jeff Mitchell; transferred by Jeff Mitchell; source: AKG CK1 > Nbob Actives > Audioroot Femto > F8n [2]. Also: Transfer chain: SDXC card to Samplitude Pro X5, dBpoweramp, Live Show Tagger, then TLH [2]",
